  "findings": "Dedicated green spine-bearing branches with distributed yellow spring flowers replace broad leaf masses and pink terminal rings. Dense prickly 1.0-2.1 m forms; modified leaf spines count as foliage rather than pretending broad leaves exist. Individual spine tips and pea corollas simplify to coarse cells at 25 mm. Actually reviewed botanical photos, current seeds 1,4,7 and all 36 variants. Accepted spring source; user endorsement remains separate.",
